## Interface: 16001
## Title: Tandem
## Notes: Dual-boxing helper. Sets of your characters on different accounts find each other at login, group up, switch to free-for-all loot and turn the sound off on all but the main. With Upkeep, clickable reminders to focus the main and to cast a login spell such as a stance.
## Author: Martin
## Version: 1.0.0
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\Achievement_GuildPerk_HaveGroup WillTravel
## OptionalDeps: Upkeep
## SavedVariables: TandemDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: TandemCharDB

